❌ Could not fetch channel data.

Possible reasons:
• the channel is private;
• the channel does not exist;
• Telegram is temporarily unavailable;
• API limit exceeded.

Try again later.

how_it_works:
📘 HOW IT WORKS

The bot collects the latest posts of a public Telegram channel and analyzes them with AI.

It determines:
• topics and audience;
• content quality and originality;
• advertising load;
• potential risk signals.

Limitations:
• only public channels are analyzed;
• the analysis is informational and does not guarantee accuracy;
• absence of risks does not mean the channel is safe.
